// Package carrier is kept here as a saved copy beside the carrier it was
// taken from. Its path extends that carrier's path, so a confinement
// naming the carrier and matching by character prefix would cover this
// file while a confinement matching a whole path or a path segment does
// not. It carries a citation so a run that reached it would rewrite it.
//
// spec: §10 line 437
package carrier
